<i>The rising new star of this island</i>

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.080
<i>Everyone's chiming in to just say</i>

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.200
<i>Now, get on your feet, dauntlessly</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.500
<i>Once you grab the microphone, naturally</i>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.330
<i>We're going to go wild, so check it out</i>

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.690
<i>For tonight, the very best dinner</i>

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.660
<i>Words going beyond even the color of skin</i>

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.290
<i>This universal vibration</i>

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.110
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:55.580
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.780
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.410
<i>Before the time comes
when there's no turning back</i>

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.250
<i>Let's turn things in a positive direction</i>

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:13.830
<i>If you don't take action,
you won't get anywhere</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.160
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.600
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.540
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.700
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.910
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.040
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.910
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.950
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.250
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.250
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:55.580 --> 00:01:56.970
Why...

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.760
Why are you running away?

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.610
Saya...

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:14.040
Chapter 13 Gaze

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:19.980
I...

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:25.750
I thought I'd finally gotten
to be friends with you,

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.830
but when I really thought about it,

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.170
I realized I didn't know
anything about you.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:36.340
Just when I was hoping we'd
get to see each other again...

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:40.040
Though I never expected
we'd meet like this.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.850
But you know, not getting to see you,

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.310
I felt real lonely.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.830
And so, seeing as how standing around
and chatting isn't comfortable,

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.700
well, we've decided to
have those two youngsters

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.540
spend some intimate time
in a separate room.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:19.380
Oh, my!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.260
He's a sly one.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:24.830
Incidentally, what's prepared
for them is not a set of bedding,

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.330
but only a set of blocks,
beanbags, and cards.

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:31.270
Well, well, but what a surprise.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:34.250
I wonder if she's Tetsu's future lover?

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:39.330
Oh, Mister Yamanami, it isn't
nice to tease too much.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:42.450
Ohana, you know Tetsunosuke too, don't you?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:47.080
But I had no idea those two
cared for one another.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.660
If they'd told me earlier,

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.080
I would have let them be
alone the other day as well.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:57.500
But, well, I think we can say that their
relationship is firmly established now.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:01.870
You can never tell. There's a whole
lot of depth to a woman's heart.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:07.040
Oh-ho, then does that mean I should
also put more effort into you?

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:11.250
Oh, please, Mister Yamanami!

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:15.580
Perhaps the two of you should
go to a separate room as well.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:20.290
Don't worry, I've already requested
a room for Akesato and myself.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:22.400
Let us hurry on to the
room, Mister Yamanami.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.910
Is that so?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:28.370
Pardon me, Sister Akesato.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.160
Mister Yamanami, please
excuse me for a moment.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.750
Oh, don't mind me.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.700
What is it?

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.960
Well, a patron who arrived a while ago

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.830
is insisting on seeing you,
no matter what we tell him.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:43.970
What does he look like?

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.990
Young and wearing black clothes...

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:52.200
Is he an unpleasant patron?

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.830
I suppose.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:59.320
Compared to you, I think maybe all
the other patrons are unpleasant.

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.990
I'm sorry, but turn him down for tonight.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.910
But...
All right, I'll go tell him.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:14.330
Okay, okay, where are you?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.620
Over here, over here.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.250
I am very sorry.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:26.760
Sister Akesato is engaged in
another room for today, and...

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:30.620
This was not the arrangement.
It must be Akesato.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:34.810
I'm sorry, but it seems you never made
the actual arrangement through our office.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.910
Hey there, Kitamura,

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:39.120
it's your first time and you're
asking for someone by name?

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.660
Who cares if it's someone else?
A woman's a woman.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:44.820
Trying to be choosy like you're a regular?

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:52.120
All right! I've got you now!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.750
Okay, you're "it" next!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.080
Then I've but to wait until she's free.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:04.340
What the heck? What a
spoilsport you are, whelp.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.750
I'm here as my master's representative.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.230
Don't think I'm the same as you.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.750
What's with that attitude?

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:18.480
Sheesh, just because he's
Master Yoshida's favorite...

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:43.620
<i>Those guys have got the wrong idea again.</i>

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:46.320
<i>There's no way I'd be
fooling around with women!</i>

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.210
<i>But...</i>

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:52.850
What?!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.600
To Shimabara?!

00:06:56.120 --> 00:07:00.640
We need to speak with that <i>kunoichi
</i>regarding our future plans.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:05.790
But we could just have her come to us!

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.190
Suzu...
Sir?

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:11.160
You should see a little more
of the world as well.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:12.910
Yes, sir.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.080
<i>Master...</i>

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:33.010
Where are you?! <i>They all turn
into brats when they get drunk.</i>

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.140
There!

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.660
Ouch!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.160
What was that just now?

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.040
That sure was loud, wasn't it?

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.870
Are you okay?

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.250
Yeah, I just slipped and fell, man!

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.160
But I'm not hurt, and we
didn't break anything, either!

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.830
Oh, really?

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:14.300
Thank goodness for that!

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.060
They're gone.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:23.730
So...

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.570
Why...

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.320
are you...

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.070
here?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:42.620
That sword shop and that time on the
way to Hyogo... it's always something!

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.410
That's what I should be saying to you!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:48.700
Oh, or what? Could it be you
got dumped or something?

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.500
Well, what about you?

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:53.910
Playing around like kids
with an attendant girl?

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:56.220
I bet you got cold feet, didn't you?

00:08:58.660 --> 00:08:59.510
Brat.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.180
What?!

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:06.410
I'm going back.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:09.150
So very sorry to have interrupted your fun.

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.660
Join us for a bit.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:20.450
So what game were you playing, anyway?

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.000
Blindfolded tag!

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.410
What are you?! Some kind of geezer?!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.330
I wonder if Tetsu and the girl
are having fun playing games?

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.960
Osaya certainly caught a nice boy.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:39.660
I wonder if they'll become like us someday?

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.600
Will she also...

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:45.140
take on patrons someday?

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:49.350
As long as she's here,
I think that's likely.

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:53.540
Osaya and Ohana will both
turn sixteen next year.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.330
If there's a good patron,

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:59.110
they're of an age where talk of their
first time wouldn't be surprising.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.800
Poor things.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:03.870
Tetsu probably doesn't know.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.370
You shouldn't pity her.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:11.640
No matter what means she may have to use,
Osaya will be able to live a good life.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.040
Besides, she will have a dream.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:18.590
She'll become beautiful and
cultivate herself as a woman,

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.080
and when she's become
more beautiful than anyone,

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:23.690
the man she loves from the bottom
of her heart will come for her.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.430
Unlike me.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.520
That's not true.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:34.190
It doesn't matter to me what you are.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:37.550
Please believe me.
Someday, I will surely...

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.430
Thank you.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.120
Tetsu!

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:07.180
Your... Your big brother's
coming to save you!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:14.620
Tetsunosuke!

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:37.300
Let's see, I've got 19 cards.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.120
And you've got 29?

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:42.200
Man, so it's an overwhelming
victory for Saya?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.910
You're Kyoto's greatest master
of going for the wrong card!

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.560
Shut up, you!

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:53.330
But man, I haven't played cards
in ages. It's made me so thirsty.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.070
I almost got up out of habit.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:04.040
You know, you look like you'd
make a good page or something.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:05.790
So you can tell?

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:09.240
What?! Seriously?! I'm a page too!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.160
If the guy's got someone
like you for a page,

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:15.250
your master must be a real
mild-tempered old man.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.960
Wrong!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.710
All right, you're gonna
be shocked to hear this!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:22.660
Believe it or not, there is no one
in Kyoto who does not know him!

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:25.300
The great and famous...

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.680
The famous...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:33.540
I'm the page of a certain person like that!

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:35.440
That doesn't tell me anything.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:39.040
Well, not that I'm going to press you.

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:43.120
I'm the page of someone who can't
really reveal his identity either.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:46.200
What's with that? Sounds suspicious.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.910
You in any position to talk?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.240
Then is your name a secret too?

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.410
It's Suzu Kitamura.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.960
I'm Tetsunosuke Ichimura.

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:03.870
Well, I guess we're...

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:05.550
Nah, it's nothing.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.420
<i>I'm not as bratty as he is, but...</i>

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.230
<i>I'm not as sarcastic as he is, but...</i>

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:16.730
<i>Somehow...</i>

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.150
<i>Maybe we're...</i>

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:20.920
<i>pretty alike after all.</i>

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.780
What is it, Saya?

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:30.000
Oh, you're going to bring us
snacks to go with the tea?

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.160
You'll have some too, right?

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:37.170
No, my master should be getting
here soon, so I ought to go back.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:43.200
Hang out with us for a little longer.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:46.250
Whatever!

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.510
But only for as long as it takes
to have snacks, all right?!

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.790
Then, he's here?

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:54.180
Yes, he is, but he only looked
about twelve or thirteen...

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.330
No, that's perfectly fine.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:59.700
I mean, he's fifteen, but he really doesn't
look much older than what you said.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:00.870
I see.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:04.780
I am positive that's my younger brother.
Please take me to that room.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:07.000
But sir...

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.410
If you would just ask if
he's Tetsunosuke Ichimura,

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.000
there won't be any mistake!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.280
Well...

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.330
I am begging you!

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:18.990
Before Tetsunosuke... Before my younger
brother goes down an erroneous path!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.170
What?

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:26.950
You mean, what's my master like?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:31.680
Yeah. I mean, just the way he looks
and his personality. Or can't you say?

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:33.810
Let me think.

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.730
He wraps his strong,
well-proportioned body in a black kimono.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.520
<i>Black kimono?!</i>

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:42.910
He allows his long, black hair
to play in the wind.

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.190
<i>Long hair?!</i>

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:48.400
Handsome, with a penetrating gaze.

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.320
<i>Piercing eyes?!</i>

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:54.580
Fixed upon by his sidelong glance
and beckoned by his supple fingers,

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.250
there is not a woman out there
who wouldn't surrender to him!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.500
<i>Whoa! They really are alike!</i>

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.630
Basically, someone to be
admired on all counts.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.250
What?

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:07.260
What? That's not true for you?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.000
Oh, no...

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:13.790
Suzu, you really like this
master of yours, don't you?

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.010
Of course I do.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:21.370
Being a page is a safe job where you don't
kill and you're in no danger of dying.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:24.040
Someone once told me that.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.020
That's a good thing,

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:28.530
if the person you admire
cares about your safety.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:29.400
No.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:33.110
I hate him.

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:36.120
Besides, not only does he not like me,

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.330
he hates me more than
anyone else and I'm his page!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.120
And every time I do something,
he punishes me severely.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:46.120
He's not the sort to care
about anyone else's safety,

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:48.200
so I don't get it at all.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:51.170
By the way, let me ask you something.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.200
Before you became his
subordinate and page and stuff,

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:57.060
there wasn't anything between you and him?

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.000
Of course not. Why?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.620
Well, rather than employing you
as a page, from what you've said,

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:07.370
it almost sounds more like he's
looking after you for someone.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:08.250
Looking...

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.730
after me?

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.170
Pardon me.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:30.750
Sister Akesato...

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.880
Ohana, you came at the perfect time.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:34.950
Ma'am?

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.950
How are Tetsunosuke and Osaya doing?

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:41.370
It seems another friend
showed up just a while ago,

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.120
and they sound like they're having fun.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.850
Really? I'm glad.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:49.080
And about the patron
we turned down earlier...

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:54.500
Was there a samurai all in black, with
hair covering the right side of his face?

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:58.330
Oh, that's just the thing.
He just arrived downstairs...

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.040
So this is the room?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:08.170
We came to see what this woman's like, that
he has to sleep with as part of his job.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:11.420
There's something fishy
about this, Miss Akesato.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:14.840
Say, haven't we met somewhere before?

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:20.290
Sirs, this is not acceptable!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.640
What?! Stay out of this, brat!

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.310
I am not a brat!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.730
Shut up!

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:31.000
So anyway, Miss Akesato, since
your man's fallen asleep there,

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:34.330
how about pouring sake for us now?

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:38.030
You saying you can't do what a patron asks?

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:41.370
I can't say I approve...

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:45.830
of boorish behavior that ruins
these precious moments of repose.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.420
Mister Yamanami!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.040
What's this?!

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.700
I don't know just who the hell you are,

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:58.000
but does that mean you're
in it with this woman too?!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.800
What's this? I don't see what you mean.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.220
What?!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:07.190
I don't see what you mean,
but something stinks here.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.610
Just who you are and where you're from...

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.360
Bastard!

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:20.870
Oh, I beg your pardon.

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.450
That's right, my sword was over here.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:29.750
Old man, you're getting cocky...

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.290
Can't be having this, you know.

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:36.340
Would you please not come all
the way out here just to upset him?

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:48.310
A samurai dressed all in black, is it?

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.590
That's not good.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.560
I feel like I may just boil over with rage.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:05.660
What's up with them being
so quick to pick a fight?

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:08.750
But you really helped us there!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.420
Sorry for coming so late.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:14.330
Not at all! You were terribly gallant!

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.250
You've just absolutely stolen my heart!

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.910
Thanks...

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:23.260
Oh, by the way, Mr. Yamanami,
how about we...?

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.620
Tatsu, this is embarrassing.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.170
Don't give me that "embarrassing" crap!

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:57.590
Coming to a place like this
without a word to your guardian...

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:00.200
Well, like I said...

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:03.250
If it had come down to it, I was
ready to slash my stomach

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:06.550
to go apologize to Mother
and Father in the world beyond!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:10.830
Thank goodness!
Thank goodness you're such a kiddy!

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:13.660
You didn't need to go that far!

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.110
Saya...

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:20.750
Look, Tatsu! She's laughing at me now!

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:22.500
We've met before.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:25.950
Could it be you've become friends
with Tetsunosuke since then?

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.580
No, I'm not really...

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.950
Oh, his name's Suzu.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.370
Hey!

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:33.670
And this over here's Saya.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.410
Well, well, well,

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.830
thank you for being so good to
my poorly raised Tetsunosuke.

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:41.330
Who are you calling poorly raised?!

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.970
Not again, Saya.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:48.620
I am Tetsunosuke's elder brother,
Tatsunosuke Ichimura.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:51.140
I hope you'll continue to be
good friends with him, or whatever.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.580
Your older brother?

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:56.230
Though he's a bit troublesome,
because he gets too rowdy.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.480
What?!

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:00.900
Tetsu!

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:00.900
That hurts!

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:02.820
Sorry! Sorry!

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.140
Master...

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:38.020
Suzu, get away from there.

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:41.290
You'll be tainted.

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:50.120
<i>Not the eyes of one of the
deceased, but one who is alive.</i>

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:07.910
<i>Gripping the microphone tight,
the hit parade's on parade</i>

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, how you feeling?</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.790
<i>Quite the gentleman when he's off stage</i>

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, a generous spirit too!</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:23.320
<i>Being such an honest guy,
even his life's plain</i>

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:27.290
<i>Keep building it up patiently</i>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:31.290
<i>May your dreams come true honestly</i>

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:35.120
<i>Let's go for it again today, Jimmy</i>

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:40.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:44.500
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

