Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:29.000
<i>Uh-oh! Did puppy boy get
depressed because of me?!</i>

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.580
<i>It is not your fault, Mr. Todo!</i>

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:33.950
<i>There's a deep, deep reason for this,
related to a secret between us brothers!</i>

00:23:33.950 --> 00:23:37.350
